ated | `Renderer::RecreateSwapchain` throws; surviv\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ming it rebuilds the output and overlay pipelines and re-initialises ImGui's Vulkan backend, whose frag\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m   \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mment stage follow\u001b[30G the format. lavapipe\u001b[52Gcannot change format, so it is tested on a GPU.\u001b[100G|      \u001b[108G      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 364 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 365 \u001b[22m **Feature doc:** [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mrendering\u001b[39m](rendering.md).\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[22m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
