[0.031, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 32 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| 2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j26-exact-darks\"\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m></a>The dev tools' palette exact on the frame, two of J26's bull\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mets: the style\u001b[26Gh\u001b[28Gnds ImGui the palette's own bytes and the UI's fragment stage (`assets/shaders/imgui.f\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Brag`, ImGui's with a\u001b[32Gdecode) turns \u001b[47Gh\u001b[49Gm into\u001b[56Glin\u001b[60Gar light after\u001b[75Gthe 8-bit p\u001b[87Gcking on an \u001b[100GRGB attachment\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B, so Mocha's `#1e1e2e` n\u001b[36G longe\u001b[43G lands as `#1c1c2e`; the them\u001b[73G no longer depends on the\u001b[99Gattachment (`IR\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Benderer::UiColoursLinearised` gone), \u001b[49Go a\u001b[53Gswap of it\u001b[64Gleaves nothing to \u001b[83Ge-a\u001b[87Gply,\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gd a swapchain whose \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bformat changes is J27's. ThemeTests lands\u001b[53G264 of 264\u001b[64Gch\u001b[67Gnnels on the pal\u001b[84Gtte; a l\u001b[93Gvapipe frame reads `#\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B1e1e2e`, `#181825` and `#11111b`; the reference views and the\u001b[73Gsmoke test unchanged ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mUI\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](ui.md)) |     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 33 \u001b[22m | 2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"transit-end-speeds\"\u001b[39m></a>A motion profile with a speed at each end, for Manifest's\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m L37: `Transit::EndSpeeds` along the way, closed-form `Seconds`, `Covered` and\u001b[90G`Thrust` (the\u001b[104Gstart'\u001b[111G an\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bd the\u001b[17Gend's apart, `EndThrust`),\u001b[44Gends \u001b[50G profil\u001b[58G cannot m\u001b[68Get refused with their\u001b[90Greason (`CheckEnds`: `Ba\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bckward`, `AboveCruise`, `Unreachable`),\u001b[51Gand th\u001b[59Grest of \u001b[68Gach \u001b[73Gnd's veloci\u001b[85Gy car\u001b[91Gied by a drift off the\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bway (`SplitAlong`, `Drift`, zero at both ends).\u001b[59GEnds\u001b[64Gat\u001b[67Grest\u001b[72Gare bit-iden\u001b[85Gical to before\u001b[100G(24 pinned val\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bues); with end speeds time\u001b[39Gway and\u001b[47Gthrust match a \u001b[63Gtepped integration; \u001b[84Go h\u001b[88Gsh pin, save or\u001b[104Greference\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bframe\u001b[17Gmoved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mtransit\u001b[39m](transit.md#end-speeds), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#transit)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j07-debug-renderer\"\u001b[39m></a>Jolt's debug r\u001b[72Gnderer through debug\u001b[93Gdraw,\u001b[99GJ07's\u001b[105Grow:\u001b[110G`Sna\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mpshotPicker::DrawBodies` draws each body of \u001b[56G frame by Jolt's own `Shape::Draw`, in wireframe, compou\u001b[113Gd\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B par\u001b[16Gs and offsets wh\u001b[33Gre\u001b[36GJolt has th\u001b[76Gwest snapshots as a pick is, so presen\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.042, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mets: the style\u001b[26Gh\u001b[28Gnds ImGui the palette's own bytes and the UI's fragment stage (`assets/shaders/imgui.f\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Brag`, ImGui's with a\u001b[32Gdecode) turns \u001b[47Gh\u001b[49Gm into\u001b[56Glin\u001b[60Gar light after\u001b[75Gthe 8-bit p\u001b[87Gcking on an \u001b[100GRGB attachment\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B, so Mocha's `#1e1e2e` n\u001b[36G longe\u001b[43G lands as `#1c1c2e`; the them\u001b[73G no longer depends on the\u001b[99Gattachment (`IR\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Benderer::UiColoursLinearised` gone), \u001b[49Go a\u001b[53Gswap of it\u001b[64Gleaves nothing to \u001b[83Ge-a\u001b[87Gply,\u001b[92Ga\u001b[94Gd a swapchain whose \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bformat changes is J27's. ThemeTests lands\u001b[53G264 of 264\u001b[64Gch\u001b[67Gnnels on the pal\u001b[84Gtte; a l\u001b[93Gvapipe frame reads `#\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B1e1e2e`, `#181825` and `#11111b`; the reference views and the\u001b[73Gsmoke test unchanged ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mUI\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](ui.md)) |     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 33 \u001b[22m | 2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"transit-end-speeds\"\u001b[39m></a>A motion profile with a speed at each end, for Manifest's\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m L37: `Transit::EndSpeeds` along the way, closed-form `Seconds`, `Covered` and\u001b[90G`Thrust` (the\u001b[104Gstart'\u001b[111G an\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bd the\u001b[17Gend's apart, `EndThrust`),\u001b[44Gends \u001b[50G profil\u001b[58G cannot m\u001b[68Get refused with their\u001b[90Greason (`CheckEnds`: `Ba\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bckward`, `AboveCruise`, `Unreachable`),\u001b[51Gand th\u001b[59Grest of \u001b[68Gach \u001b[73Gnd's veloci\u001b[85Gy car\u001b[91Gied by a drift off the\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bway (`SplitAlong`, `Drift`, zero at both ends).\u001b[59GEnds\u001b[64Gat\u001b[67Grest\u001b[72Gare bit-iden\u001b[85Gical to before\u001b[100G(24 pinned val\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bues); with end speeds time\u001b[39Gway and\u001b[47Gthrust match a \u001b[63Gtepped integration; \u001b[84Go h\u001b[88Gsh pin, save or\u001b[104Greference\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bframe\u001b[17Gmoved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mtransit\u001b[39m](transit.md#end-speeds), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#transit)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j07-debug-renderer\"\u001b[39m></a>Jolt's debug r\u001b[72Gnderer through debug\u001b[93Gdraw,\u001b[99GJ07's\u001b[105Grow:\u001b[110G`Sna\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mpshotPicker::DrawBodies` draws each body of \u001b[56G frame by Jolt's own `Shape::Draw`, in wireframe, compou\u001b[113Gd\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B par\u001b[16Gs and offsets wh\u001b[33Gre\u001b[36GJolt has them, placed between\u001b[66Gthe two newest snapshots as a pick is, so presen\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Btation\u001b[18Greads no simulation s\u001b[40Gate;\u001b[76G checkbox (the\u001b[91GScene panel) or the co\u001b[27;1H\u001b[21;3H\u001b[?25h"]
