[0.026, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m90\u001b[11G\u001b[22m-\u001b[13G**A thrust share keeps its m\u001b[42Ganing**: the shar\u001b[60G of\u001b[64Gt\u001b[66Ge way's own time that\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gdrive\u001b[98Gthrusts.\u001b[107GThe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 91 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  speed its thrust ends at, which it coasts at, is its \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mcruise\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m.                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 91 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  speed its thrust ends at, which it coasts at, is its \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mpeak\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m.                                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 92 \u001b[22m - **What it refuses** (`CheckEnds`, before `Seconds`, `Covered` and `Thrust`, which assert it):\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 93 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a speed negative or not finite (`Backward`); a speed above its \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mcruise\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m, the most its share can        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 93 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a speed negative or not finite (`Backward`); a speed above its \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mpeak\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m, the most its share can          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 94 \u001b[22m   reach and come back from in the time, or with no sustained acceleration the speed its boost\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[18G\u001b[22mes (`AbovePea\u001b[32G`); and a way too short \u001b[57Go\u001b[59Gspeed up or slow down from one end's speed to\u001b[105Gthe\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[13G\u001b[22mother'\u001b[23GUnreach\u001b[31Gble`).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison's\u001b[14Ggate\u001b[19Gpassed\u001b[26Gin\u001b[29G240\u001b[33Gs.\u001b[36GNow\u001b[40GManifest's,\u001b[52Gfor\u001b[56GL53.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11Gcd\u001b[14G'/home/ivan/projects/manifest'\u001b[45G&&\u001b[48Gexport\u001b[55GCMAKE…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest' && export CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL='24' CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL='24' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS='24'; ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --tidy --log build/gate.log > /dev/null 2>&1 (11m 3s)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GSketching… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Run Manifest's batch gate · 16m 55s · ↓\u001b[55G5.5k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use Plan Mode to prepare\u001b[36Gfor a complex request bef\u001b[62Gr\u001b[64G making changes. Press shift+tab twice to enable.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0041 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39mA new player joining the server, when they are granted a corporation and ship, they can name themselves and the\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  corpo\u001b[9G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;8H\u001b[?25h"]
