[0.088, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 91 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  speed its thrust ends at, which it coasts at, is its \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mpeak\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m.                                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 92 \u001b[22m - **What it refuses** (`CheckEnds`, before `Seconds`, `Covered` and `Thrust`, which assert it):\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 93 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a speed negative or not finite (`Backward`); a speed above its \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mcruise\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m, the most its share can        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 93 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a speed negative or not finite (`Backward`); a speed above its \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mpeak\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m, the most its share can          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 94 \u001b[22m   reach and come back from in the time, or with no sustained acceleration the speed its boost\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 95 \u001b[22m   reaches (`AbovePeak`); and a way too short to speed up or slow down from one end's speed to the\u001b[K\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[13G\u001b[22mother's (`Unr\u001b[27Gachable`).\u001b[38G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison's gate passed in 240 s. Now\u001b[40GManifest's,\u001b[52Gfor\u001b[56GL53.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunn\u001b[8Gng cd\u001b[14G'/home/ivan/project\u001b[34G/manifest' && export CMAKE…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest' && export CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL='24' CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL='24' \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mMANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS='24'; ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --tidy --log build/gate.log > /dev/null 2>&1 (11m 19s)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ A new player joining the server, when they are granted a corporation and ship, they can name themselves and the \u001b[39m      \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mcorporation. They also need to be able to name the ship at the same time.\u001b[39m                                             \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mSketching… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Run Manifest's batch\u001b[36Ggate · 17m 12s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m5.5k t\u001b[62Gk\u001b[64Gns)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Use Plan Mode to prepare for a complex request before making changes. Press shift+tab twice to enable.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0041 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[2mPress up to edit queued messages\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[37C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent · ↓ to manage\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
