[0.056, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 88 \u001b[22m - **The boost is spent at the slow ends.** An end already moving at more than the boost reaches\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m89\u001b[11G\u001b[22m \u001b[13Gspends\u001b[20Gnone of its boost; one moving slower spends what is left of it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 90 \u001b[22m - **A thrust share keeps its meaning**: the share of the way's own time that the drive thrusts. The\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 91 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  speed its thrust ends at, which it coasts at, is its \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mcruise\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m.                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 91 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  speed its thrust ends at, which it coasts at, is its \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mpeak\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m.                                           \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m2\u001b[11G\u001b[22m-\u001b[13G**What it refuses** (`CheckEnds`, before `Seconds`,\u001b[65G`Covered` and `Th\u001b[83Gust`, which a\u001b[97Gs\u001b[99Grt\u001b[102Git):\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 93 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a speed negative or not finite (`Backward`); a speed above its \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mcruise\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m, the most its share can        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 93 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a speed negative or not finite (`Backward`); a speed above its \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mpeak\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m, the most its share can          \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 94 \u001b[22m   reach and come back from\u001b[38Gin\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Gtime,\u001b[51Gor\u001b[54Gwith\u001b[59Gno\u001b[62Gsustained\u001b[72Gacceleration\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gspeed\u001b[95Gits\u001b[99Gboost\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 95 \u001b[13G\u001b[22mreaches\u001b[21G(`AbovePeak`);\u001b[36Gand\u001b[40Ga\u001b[42Gway\u001b[46Gtoo\u001b[50Gshort\u001b[56Gto\u001b[59Gspeed\u001b[65Gup\u001b[68Gor\u001b[71Gslow\u001b[76Gdown\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86Gone\u001b[90Gend's\u001b[96Gspeed\u001b[102Gto\u001b[105Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 96 \u001b[22m   other's (`Unreachable`).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison's gate passed in 240 s. Now Manifest's, for L53.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[9B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
