[0.102, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m255\u001b[12G\u001b[22m`stage-bun\u001b[23Gle.sh` refuses a c\u001b[42Geckout\u001b[49Gwith changes, since a\u001b[71Gbundle names its commit. It strips the\u001b[110G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m256\u001b[12G\u001b[22mbundle's\u001b[21Gprograms and keeps\u001b[40Gtheir debug files\u001b[58Gbeside i\u001b[67G, by build ID, in `debug-<bundle>.tar.gz`,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 257 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor crash reports ([the host](host.md#staging-and-testing-the-bundle)).                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 257 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor crash reports. The debug files hold line tables alone (`-gline-tables-only` in `clang-release`,   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 258 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhich leaves the machine code unchanged), so a symbolised frame names its function, file and line ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mth\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m   \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;230;219;116me host\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](host.md#staging-and-testing-the-bundle)).                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 259 \u001b[22m `test-bundle.sh` unpacks the tarball into a read-only directory and runs `bundle-smoke.sh` on it\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 260 \u001b[22m under `env -i`, on this machine and in the containers named (Docker).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 261 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ git -C '/home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-c' add CMakePresets.json docs/build-and-gates.md && git -C \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m'/home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-c' commit -q -m 'Release: line tables in clang-release, so a crash report names \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfile and line\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m-glin\u001b[12G-tables-only leaves the ma\u001b[39Ghine code unchan\u001b[56Ged: eight of the …\r\u001b[14C\u001b[2B3m 34s\u001b[22G· ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m15.7k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle)\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
