[0.042, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lin\u001b[18Gs,\u001b[21Gremoved \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 254 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 255 \u001b[22m `stage-bundle.sh` refuses a checkout with changes, since a bundle names its commit. It strips the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 256 \u001b[22m bundle's programs and keeps their debug files beside it, by build ID, in `debug-<bundle>.tar.gz`,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 257 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor crash reports ([the host](host.md#staging-and-testing-the-bundle)).                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 257 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor crash reports. The debug files hold line tables alone (`-gline-tables-only` in `clang-release`,   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 258 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhich leaves the machine code unchanged), so a symbolised frame names its function, file and line ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mth\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m     +\u001b[38;2;230;219;116me host\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](host.md#staging-and-testing-the-bundle)).                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 259 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m`test-bundle.sh`\u001b[29Gunpacks\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gtarball\u001b[49Ginto\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gread-only\u001b[66Gdirectory\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gruns\u001b[85G`bundle-smoke.sh`\u001b[103Gon\u001b[106Git\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 260 \u001b[22m und\u001b[16Gr `env -i`, on\u001b[31Gthis\u001b[36Gmachine\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gin\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gcontainers\u001b[66Gnamed\u001b[72G(Docker).\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 261 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning git -C '/home/ivan/projects/manifest'\u001b[49