[0.059, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe container runs automated.\u001b[22m CI's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtest-bundle.sh\u001b[55G\u001b[39mstep runs\u001b[65Gonly\u001b[70G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhost\u001b[75G\u001b[39mtoday.\u001b[82GI'd\u001b[86Gadd\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94GUbuntu\u001b[101G24.04\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111GDebian\u001b[118G13\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gruns to GitHub Actions, whose\u001b[35Grunners have Docker; Docker is a\u001b[68Gso here locally to try them first. We'd only see the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BCI \u001b[9Gide\u001b[13Gwork on the \u001b[26Gext pu\u001b[33Gh.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThat would cl\u001b[19Gse L41.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJettison lane C: J12, a glTF model's collision shape\u001b[56G\u001b[22m(recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- A small tool bakes a model's collision shape into a file b\u001b[64Gside the\u001b[73Gmodel.\u001b[80GIt\u001b[83Guses\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gmodel's\u001b[100Gown\u001b[104G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcollision-\u001b[115G\u001b[39mnodes,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gor convex hulls simplifi\u001b[30Gd from the drawn m\u001b[49Gsh. Physics reads that file, so client\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gserver c\u001b[101Gllide with the same\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbytes. The approach was decided\u001b[37Gon 2026-11-27.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt matters\u001b[16Gto Manifest becaus\u001b[35G a hull drawn from\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gmodel\u001b[62Gcurrently\u001b[72Gcollides\u001b[81Gas\u001b[84Gits\u001b[88Gbox.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bworks in physics, dock \u001b[32Gnd tools; J26 is\u001b[49Gin the\u001b[56GUI, so they don't meet. It doe\u001b[88Gneed\u001b[93Ga\u001b[95Gnew\u001b[99Gfile\u001b[104Gformat,\u001b[112Gwhich\u001b[118GI'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Grecord in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdecisions.md\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSmaller Jettison alternative: J29, the ground sample's rover.\u001b[65G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[69Grover\u001b[75Gslides\u001b[82Glike\u001b[87Ga\u001b[89Gbox,\u001b[94Gso\u001b[97Git\u001b[100Gwould\u001b[106Gbe\u001b[109Ggiven\u001b[115Ggrip.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIt only touches the sample, so it's the safest, but it's of little us\u001b[73G to Manifest.\u001b[87G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G    \u001b[11G       \u001b[19G   \u001b[23G       \u001b[31G  \u001b[34G    \u001b[39G   \u001b[43G    \u001b[77G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
