[0.431, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mMost\u001b[8Gof\u001b[11GManifest's\u001b[22Gqueue\u001b[28Gcan't\u001b[34Gstart\u001b[40Gyet:\u001b[45Gthose\u001b[51Grows\u001b[56Gneed\u001b[61Ggame\u001b[66Grules\u001b[72Gyou\u001b[76Ghaven't\u001b[84Gsettled,\u001b[93Gor\u001b[96Gthey\u001b[101Gwork\u001b[106Gin\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gspace\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gm\u001b[5Gdule,\u001b[11Gwhich L37 is rebuilding. Of th\u001b[42G rest, these ar\u001b[58G ready and won't cl\u001b[78Gsh with L37 or\u001b[93GJ26.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest lane C: L41's remaining two parts\u001b[46G\u001b[22m(recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mThe termi\u001b[15Gal UI resends \u001b[30G lost\u001b[36Grequest.\u001b[22m It would ke\u001b[57Gp each\u001b[64Grequest\u001b[72Git\u001b[75Gsent\u001b[80Guntil\u001b[86Git\u001b[89Ghears\u001b[95Gthat\u001b[100Grequest\u001b[108Gcomplete.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GThis lives in the console tool, which L37 doesn't touch.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe container runs automated.\u001b[22m CI's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtest-bundle.sh\u001b[55G\u001b[39mstep runs\u001b[65Gonly\u001b[70G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhost\u001b[75G\u001b[39mtoday.\u001b[82GI'd\u001b[86Gadd\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94GUbuntu\u001b[101G24.04\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111GDebian\u001b[118G13\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gruns to GitHub Actions, whose\u001b[35Grunners have Docker; Docker is a\u001b[68Gso here locally to try them first. We'd only see the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BCI \u001b[9Gide\u001b[13Gwork on the \u001b[26Gext pu\u001b[33Gh.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThat would cl\u001b[19Gse L41.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJettison lane C: J12, a glTF model's collision shape\u001b[56G\u001b[22m(recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- A small tool bakes a model's collision shape into a file b\u001b[64Gside the\u001b[73Gmodel.\u001b[80GIt\u001b[83Guses\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gmodel's\u001b[100Gown\u001b[104G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcollision-\u001b[115G\u001b[39mnodes,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gor convex hulls simplifi\u001b[30Gd from the drawn m\u001b[49Gsh. Physics reads that file, so client\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gserver c\u001b[101Gllide with the same\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbytes. The approach was decided\u001b[37Gon 2026-11-27.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt matters\u001b[16Gto Manifest becaus\u001b[35G a hull draw\u001b[76Gides\u001b[81Gas\u001b[84Gits\u001b[88Gbox.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
