[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJettison lane C: J12, a glTF model's collision shape\u001b[56G\u001b[22m(recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- A small tool bakes a model's collision shape into a file b\u001b[64Gside the\u001b[73Gmodel.\u001b[80GIt\u001b[83Guses\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gmodel's\u001b[100Gown\u001b[104G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcollision-\u001b[115G\u001b[39mnodes,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gor convex hulls simplifi\u001b[30Gd from the drawn m\u001b[49Gsh. Physics reads that file, so client\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gserver c\u001b[101Gllide with the same\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbytes. The approach was decided\u001b[37Gon 2026-11-27.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt matters\u001b[16Gto Manifest becaus\u001b[35G a hull drawn from\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gmodel\u001b[62Gcurrently\u001b[72Gcollides\u001b[81Gas\u001b[84Gits\u001b[88Gbox.\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1Bworks in physics, dock \u001b[32Gnd tools; J26 is\u001b[49Gin the\u001b[56GUI, so they don't meet. It doe\u001b[88Gneed\u001b[93Ga\u001b[95Gnew\u001b[99Gfile\u001b[104Gformat,\u001b[112Gwhich\u001b[118GI'd\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Grecord in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdecisions.md\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSmaller Jettison alternative: J29, the ground sample's rover.\u001b[65G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[69Grover\u001b[75Gslides\u001b[82Glike\u001b[87Ga\u001b[89Gbox,\u001b[94Gso\u001b[97Git\u001b[100Gwould\u001b[106Gbe\u001b[109Ggiven\u001b[115Ggrip.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIt only touches the sample, so it's the safest, but it's of little us\u001b[73G to Manifest.\u001b[87G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot now:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- J64 (vertex\u001b[17Gpulling):\u001b[27Glarge,\u001b[34Gand\u001b[38Gevery\u001b[44Greference\u001b[54Gframe\u001b[60Gis\u001b[63Gat\u001b[66Grisk.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B16: its own roadmap row says to\u001b[38Gtake it up o\u001b[51Gly\u001b[54Gwhen needed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\