[0.105, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Glost connection, and resends under the original sequence numbers. The server already recognised a repeated number\u001b[119Gas\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthe same request, so nothing runs twice. The \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mconsole\u001b[39m suite proves that for a buy whose completion was lost. No\u001b[116Gnew\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdeduplication was needed; the choice is recorded as D-125.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContainer runs:\u001b[22m CI now runs the bundle in Ubuntu 24.04 and Debian 13, one step each, so a failure names the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdistribution. Both passed locally under Docker. The GitHub side hasn't run yet; it will on the next push.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFixed at merge:\u001b[22m the agent's formatting had split a string literal in a test list, which tidy would have flagged.\u001b[118GI\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Brewrote that test line so it isn't split, and the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mconsole\u001b[39m suite passes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDocs:\u001b[22m L41 moved from the queue to the history, the queue renumbered, and the links that pointed at its queue entry\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnow point at the history row. The local link check is clean.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BOne limit is left and documented: a request the server completed and then lost in a crash, before writing it to\u001b[115Gits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bjournal, isn't resent. The requests after it are refused, and the player re-checks with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mobserve\u001b[39m and sends what is\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmissing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BL37 and J12 are still running. If L37 also adds a decision numbered D-125, I'll renumber it when I merge.\u001b[K\r\u001b[25C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m8\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.041, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[16B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GWaiting for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m background agents to\u001b[38Gfinish\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \u001b[2mhow are the lanes getting on?\r\u001b[41C\u001b[3B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m← 1\u001b[46Gagent · ↓ to\u001b[59Gmanage\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[20;3H\u001b[?25h"]
