[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mClash:\u001b[22m L37\u001b[16Gis editing the\u001b[31Gcl\u001b[34Gent's screen a\u001b[49Gd style files,\u001b[64Gso\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Greconnecting\u001b[84Glane\u001b[89Gwould\u001b[95Gshow\u001b[100Gits\u001b[104Gstatus\u001b[111Gthrough\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe existing status line and no\u001b[37G edit those files. Its other cod\u001b[71Gdoes\u001b[76G't overlap with L37.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJettison lane B: shaders that reload as they change\u001b[55G\u001b[22m(J27\u001b[60Grow)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- J14 already reloads other assets live; shaders are the\u001b[60Ggap.\u001b[65GEditing\u001b[73Ga\u001b[75G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m.frag\u001b[81G\u001b[39mwould\u001b[87Gshow\u001b[92Gin\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Grunning\u001b[107Gshell\u001b[113Gwithout\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ga restart.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt's in \u001b[14Ghe\u001b[17Grenderer's\u001b[28Gprograms\u001b[37Gand\u001b[41Gpipelines,\u001b[52Gand\u001b[56Gnothing\u001b[64Gelse\u001b[69Gis\u001b[72Grunning\u001b[80Gin\u001b[83GJettison.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJettison lane C: a model file read once\u001b[43G\u001b[22m(J27\u001b[48Grow)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- A model file is read twice today, once for\u001b[48Gits rig\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60Gonce\u001b[65Gfor\u001b[69Gits\u001b[73Ggeometry.\u001b[83GThis\u001b[88Gis\u001b[91Ga\u001b[93Gsmall\u001b[99Gchange\u001b[106Gin\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gmodel\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gloader,\u001b[13Gwhich \u001b[20Ghader\u001b[26Greloading does\u001b[41G't\u001b[44Gt\u001b[46Guch.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAlternative:\u001b[22m J29, the rover's grip, which only\u001b[52Gtouches\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gsample.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot now:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- J27's swapchain\u001b[21Gformat\u001b[28Gchange:\u001b[36Git\u001b[39Gcan\u