[0.020, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mWhen it appears:\u001b[22m at start, if no server\u001b[45Gwas\u001b[49Ggiven\u001b[55Gon\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gcommand\u001b[70Gline.\u001b[76GPointing\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gclient\u001b[96Gat\u001b[99Ga\u001b[101Gserver\u001b[108Gfrom\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcommand\u001b[13Gline\u001b[18Gstill\u001b[24Gworks\u001b[30Gas\u001b[33Git\u001b[36Gdoes\u001b[41Gnow.\r\u001b[1B  - \u001b[1mWhat it does:\u001b[22m lists the saved servers and lets the player add, remove or connect to one. It pins a server's key as\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B    the terminal UI does, and shows refusals in all four languages.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe token:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  - Stored in your own\u001b[26Gdirectory\u001b[36Gwith\u001b[41Gowner-only\u001b[52Gaccess\u001b[59G(mode 0600)\u001b[71Gfrom\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gmoment\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gfile\u001b[96Gis\u001b[99Gcreated.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GNever\u001b[13Glogged,\u001b[21Gnever\u001b[27Gshown\u001b[33Gin\u001b[36Gfull\u001b[41Gafter\u001b[47Git's\u001b[52Gtyped,\u001b[59Gand\u001b[63Gnever\u001b[69Gwritten\u001b[77Ginto\u001b[82Ga\u001b[84Gcrash\u001b[90Greport\u001b[97Gor\u001b[100Ga\u001b[102Gsave.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  - A test checks both the file's mode and that\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55Gtoken\u001b[61Gisn't\u001b[67Gin\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Glog.\r\u001b[1B  - \u001b[1mFiles:\u001b[12G\u001b[22mit reuses the terminal\u001b[35GUI's\u001b[40Gserver-list\u001b[52Gformat\u001b[59Grather\u001b[66Gthan\u001b[71Ginventing\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gsecond\u001b[90Gone.\u001b[95GIt\u001b[98Gadds\u001b[103Gits\u001b[107Gown\u001b[111Gscreen\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfile\u001b[10Gand l\u001b[16Gaves the f\u001b[27Gle\u001b[30G L37 is restyling\u001b[48Galone.\u001b[55GAny\u001b[59Gstyle\u001b[65Git\u001b[68Gstill\u001b[74Gneeds\u001b[80GI'll\u001b[85Gadd\u001b[89Gat\u001b[92Gmerge.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAll four lanes are busy again: L37, shader reloading, model files read once, and the server picker.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[18;3H\u001b[?25h"]
