\u001b[39m></a>The\u001b[62Ggame\u001b[67GUI\u001b[70Gfollowing\u001b[80G`dev.palette`\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98G`em`'s\u001b[105Gitalic,\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mwo of J26's bullets: `ui/base.rcss` ends with an `@media (theme: ...)\u001b[81G block for Latte, Frappé and Macc\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bhiato, each\u001b[23Gresta\u001b[29Ging every colour rule in its palette's\u001b[68Grol\u001b[72Gs, and `UiSystem::SetTheme` (RmlUi's `Acti\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BvateTheme`,\u001b[23Gone theme\u001b[33Gat a time) tak\u001b[76Ge shell wh\u001b[87Gre it applies the dev\u001b[109Gtools\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.044, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Band no model; `ReadCollisionFile` rea\u001b[49Gs one through the\u001b[67GVFS, and `ConvexHullPoints` simpl\u001b[101Gfies\u001b[106Gp\u001b[108Gints w\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bith\u001b[15GJ\u001b[17Glt's convex hul\u001b[33G bu\u001b[37Glder. \u001b[44Gjetti\u001b[50Gon_bake_collision` (`source/tools/co\u001b[87Glision\u001b[94G) bakes one\u001b[106Gthrough\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B`Bake::CollisionShape`, the library \u001b[48Ghe cook is to call: `collision-<name>` nodes are convex hulls, `co\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bllision-mesh-<name>` meshes, and a mod\u001b[50Gl with neither a convex hull of each\u001b[87Gmesh nod\u001b[97Gof at most 32\u001b[111Gpoi\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bnts. A dock vehicle names one (`Vehicl\u001b[50GDef\u001b[54Gnition::collision`,\u001b[74Goptional, so\u001b[87Gevery file re\u001b[101Gds a\u001b[106G before)\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B and\u001b[16Gcollides as it, \u001b[33G mesh refus\u001b[45Gd. The physics suite drops crates on a\u001b[84Gfil\u001b[88G's pods and the\u001b[104Gkeel betwe\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Ben them where\u001b[25Gthe box would\u001b[39Ghold them; the baker'\u001b[61G suite bakes \u001b[75G model\u001b[82Gwith `collision-`\u001b[100Gnodes and one\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwithout, the sam\u001b[30Gytes twice; `bak\u001b[47G_collision_cli` runs\u001b[68Gthe tool; the\u001b[82Gdock\u001b[87Gsuite defines a vehicle fro\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bm one. No pin moved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mphysics\u001b[39m](physics.md#a-mode\u001b[60Gs-collision-shape), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#physics))\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-28\u001b[24G|\u001b[26G<a\u001b[29G\u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j26-theme-following\"\u001b[39m></a>The\u001b[62Ggame\u001b[67GUI\u001b[70Gfollowing\u001b[80G`dev.palette`\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98G`em`'s\u001b[105Gitalic,\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mwo of J26's bullets: `ui/base.rcss` ends with an `@media (theme: ...)\u001b[81G block for Latte, Frappé and Macc\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bhiato, each\u001b[23Gresta\u001b[29Ging every colour rule in its palette's\u001b[68Grol\u001b[72Gs, and `UiSystem::SetTheme` (RmlUi's `Acti\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BvateTheme`,\u001b[23Gone theme\u001b[33Gat a time) takes the\u001b[54Gpalette's name from the shell wh\u001b[87Gre it applies the dev\u001b[109Gtools\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B' \u001b[14Ghem\u001b[18G; Mocha has no\u001b[33Gblock, so the \u001b[76G.\u001b[78GT\u001b[81GmeTests holds each block to\u001b[109Gits p\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.007, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B`Bake::C\u001b[20GllisionShape`, the l\u001b[41Gbrary the\u001b[51Gcook is to call: `collision-<name>` n\u001b[89Gdes are convex hulls, `co\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bllisi\u001b[17Gn-mesh-<name>` meshes, and a model with neither a convex hull \u001b[80Gf ea\u001b[85Gh me\u001b[90Gh \u001b[93Gode of at mos\u001b[107G 32 poi\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bnts. A d\u001b[20Gck vehicle names one (`Vehicl\u001b[50GDefinition::\u001b[63Go\u001b[66Gision`, optional, so\u001b[87Gevery\u001b[93Gfile reads\u001b[104Gas before)\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B and collides as it,\u001b[32Ga mesh refused. The\u001b[52Gphysics suite dr\u001b[69Gps crates\u001b[80Gn\u001b[82Ga file'\u001b[90G pods and\u001b[100Gthe keel betwe\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Ben them where the box would hold t\u001b[46Gem; the baker's suite bakes\u001b[74Ga model with\u001b[87G`collis\u001b[95Gon-` nodes and \u001b[111Gn\u001b[113G\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwithout, th\u001b[23G s\u001b[26Gme bytes twice; `bake_collision_cli` runs the\u001b[72Gtool; the\u001b[82Gdock suite \u001b[94Gefi\u001b[98Ges a vehicle fro\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bm one. No pin\u001b[25Gmoved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mphysics\u001b[39m](physics.md#a-model\u001b[61G-collision-\u001b[73Gh\u001b[75Gpe), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#physics))\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m|\u001b[13G2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j26-theme-following\"\u001b[39m></a>The game UI following\u001b[80G`dev.palette` and `em`'s ital\u001b[111G, t\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwo\u001b[14Gof\u001b[17GJ26's\u001b[23Gbullets:\u001b[32G`ui/base.rcss`\u001b[47Gends\u001b[52Gwith\u001b[57Gan\u001b[60G`@media\u001b[68G(theme:\u001b[76G...)`\u001b[82Gblock\u001b[88Gfor\u001b[92GLatte,\u001b[99GFrappé\u001b[106Gand\u001b[110GMacc\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mhiato, each rest\u001b[28Gting every colour rule in its palette's roles, and `UiSystem::S\u001b[92GtTheme\u001b[99G (RmlU\u001b[106G's `Acti\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BvateTheme`,\u001b[23Gone theme at a time) tak\u001b[48Gs the palette's name fro\u001b[73G the shell where it \u001b[94Gpplies the dev tools\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B' theme; Mocha h\u001b[28Gs \u001b[31Go\u001b[33Gblock, so the reference views are unchanged. ThemeTests holds \u001b[96Gach\u001b[100Gblock to\u001b[109Gits p\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Balette, UiTests\u001b[27Gse\u001b[30Gs the\u001b[36Gtext swi\u001b[45Gch from `#cdd6f4` to Latte's\u001b[74G`#4c4f69`. The shell load\u001b[101GRoboto I\u001b[110Galic\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B 3.009 (Tra\u001b[23Gy's copy,\u001b[33GOFL beside it)\u001b[76Galic RmlUi alrea\u001b[93Gy\u001b[95Glogged each faceles\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bnts. A d\u001b[20Gck vehicle names one (`Vehicl\u001b[50GDefinition::\u001b[63Go\u001b[66Gision`, optional, so\u001b[87Gevery\u001b[93Gfile reads\u001b[104Gas before)\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B and collides as it,\u001b[32Ga mesh refused. The\u001b[52Gphysics suite dr\u001b[69Gps crates\u001b[80Gn\u001b[82Ga file'\u001b[90G pods and\u001b[100Gthe keel betwe\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Ben them where the box would hold t\u001b[46Gem; the baker's suite bakes\u001b[74Ga model with\u001b[87G`collis\u001b[95Gon-` nodes and \u001b[111Gn\u001b[113G\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwithout, th\u001b[23G s\u001b[26Gme bytes twice; `bake_collision_cli` runs the\u001b[72Gtool; the\u001b[82Gdock suite \u001b[94Gefi\u001b[98Ges a vehicle fro\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bm one. No pin\u001b[25Gmoved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mphysics\u001b[39m](physics.md#a-model\u001b[61G-collision-\u001b[73Gh\u001b[75Gpe), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#physics))\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m|\u001b[13G2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j26-theme-following\"\u001b[39m></a>The game UI following\u001b[80G`dev.palette` and `em`'s ital\u001b[111G, t\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwo\u001b[14Gof\u001b[17GJ26's\u001b[23Gbullets:\u001b[32G`ui/base.rcss`\u001b[47Gends\u001b[52Gwith\u001b[57Gan\u001b[60G`@media\u001b[68G(theme:\u001b[76G...)`\u001b[82Gblock\u001b[88Gfor\u001b[92GLatte,\u001b[99GFrappé\u001b[106Gand\u001b[110GMacc\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mhiato, each rest\u001b[28Gting every colour rule in its palette's roles, and `UiSystem::S\u001b[92GtTheme\u001b[99G (RmlU\u001b[106G's `Acti\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BvateTheme`,\u001b[23Gone theme at a time) tak\u001b[48Gs the palette's name fro\u001b[73G the shell where it \u001b[94Gpplies the dev tools\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B' theme; Mocha h\u001b[28Gs \u001b[31Go\u001b[33Gblock, so the reference views are unchanged. ThemeTests holds \u001b[96Gach\u001b[100Gblock to\u001b[109Gits p\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Balette, UiTests\u001b[27Gse\u001b[30Gs the\u001b[36Gtext swi\u001b[45Gch from `#cdd6f4` to Latte's\u001b[74G`#4c4f69`. The shell load\u001b[101GRoboto I\u001b[110Galic\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B 3.009 (Tra\u001b[23Gy's copy,\u001b[33GOFL beside it) so an `\u001b[56Gm` draws; with no italic RmlUi alrea\u001b[93Gy\u001b[95Glogged each faceles\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bs text as a probl\u001b[29Gm,\u001b[32Gso no report was added ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mUI\u001b[39m](ui.md)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m35\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2\u001b[15G26-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j27-emissive-s\u001b[76G\u001b[39mer draw, J27's row, for Manifest's noz\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.031, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Ben them where the box would hold t\u001b[46Gem; the baker's suite bakes\u001b[74Ga model with\u001b[87G`collis\u001b[95Gon-` nodes and \u001b[111Gn\u001b[113G\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwithout, th\u001b[23G s\u001b[26Gme bytes twice; `bake_collision_cli` runs the\u001b[72Gtool; the\u001b[82Gdock suite \u001b[94Gefi\u001b[98Ges a vehicle fro\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bm one. No pin\u001b[25Gmoved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mphysics\u001b[39m](physics.md#a-model\u001b[61G-collision-\u001b[73Gh\u001b[75Gpe), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#physics))\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m|\u001b[13G2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j26-theme-following\"\u001b[39m></a>The game UI following\u001b[80G`dev.palette` and `em`'s ital\u001b[111G, t\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwo\u001b[14Gof\u001b[17GJ26's\u001b[23Gbullets:\u001b[32G`ui/base.rcss`\u001b[47Gends\u001b[52Gwith\u001b[57Gan\u001b[60G`@media\u001b[68G(theme:\u001b[76G...)`\u001b[82Gblock\u001b[88Gfor\u001b[92GLatte,\u001b[99GFrappé\u001b[106Gand\u001b[110GMacc\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mhiato, each rest\u001b[28Gting every colour rule in its palette's roles, and `UiSystem::S\u001b[92GtTheme\u001b[99G (RmlU\u001b[106G's `Acti\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BvateTheme`,\u001b[23Gone theme at a time) tak\u001b[48Gs the palette's name fro\u001b[73G the shell where it \u001b[94Gpplies the dev tools\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B' theme; Mocha h\u001b[28Gs \u001b[31Go\u001b[33Gblock, so the reference views are unchanged. ThemeTests holds \u001b[96Gach\u001b[100Gblock to\u001b[109Gits p\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Balette, UiTests\u001b[27Gse\u001b[30Gs the\u001b[36Gtext swi\u001b[45Gch from `#cdd6f4` to Latte's\u001b[74G`#4c4f69`. The shell load\u001b[101GRoboto I\u001b[110Galic\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B 3.009 (Tra\u001b[23Gy's copy,\u001b[33GOFL beside it) so an `\u001b[56Gm` draws; with no italic RmlUi alrea\u001b[93Gy\u001b[95Glogged each faceles\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bs text as a probl\u001b[29Gm,\u001b[32Gso no report was added ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mUI\u001b[39m](ui.md)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m35\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2\u001b[15G26-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j27-emissive-scale\"\u001b[39m></a>An emi\u001b[64Gsive scale per draw, J27's row, for Manifest's noz\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bzle glow:\u001b[23Gmesh's `emissiveScale` (`Scen\u001b[53G::MeshComponent`;\u001b[71Grgb\u001b[75Ga\u001b[77Gtint,\u001b[83Ga\u001b[85Ga\u001b[87Gscale\u001b[93Gon\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gintensity,\u001b[111Gall\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m one by default, written only where \u001b[76Gmultiplies it\u001b[91Gmaterial's emis\u001b[107Give\u001b[111Gpar\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.032, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwithout, the sam\u001b[30Gytes twice; `bak\u001b[47G_collision_cli` runs\u001b[68Gthe tool; the\u001b[82Gdock\u001b[87Gsuite defines a vehicle fro\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bm one. No pin moved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mphysics\u001b[39m](physics.md#a-mode\u001b[60Gs-collision-shape), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#physics))\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m34\u001b[11G\u001b[22m| 2026-11-28\u001b[24G|\u001b[26G<a\u001b[29G\u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j26-theme-following\"\u001b[39m></a>The\u001b[62Ggame\u001b[67GUI\u001b[70Gfollowing\u001b[80G`dev.palette`\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98G`em`'s\u001b[105Gitalic,\u001b[113Gt\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mwo of J26's bullets: `ui/base.rcss` ends with an `@media (theme: ...)\u001b[81G block for Latte, Frappé and Macc\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bhiato, each\u001b[23Gresta\u001b[29Ging every colour rule in its palette's\u001b[68Grol\u001b[72Gs, and `UiSystem::SetTheme` (RmlUi's `Acti\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1BvateTheme`,\u001b[23Gone theme\u001b[33Gat a time) takes the\u001b[54Gpalette's name from the shell wh\u001b[87Gre it applies the dev\u001b[109Gtools\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B' \u001b[14Ghem\u001b[18G; Mocha has no\u001b[33Gblock, so the refer\u001b[53Gnce views are unchanged.\u001b[78GT\u001b[81GmeTests holds each block to\u001b[109Gits p\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Balette, UiTests sees the text switch from `#cdd6f4`\u001b[63Gto Latte's `#4c4f69`. The\u001b[89Gshell\u001b[95Gloads R\u001b[103Gboto Italic\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B 3.009 (Tracy'\u001b[27Gcopy, OFL beside it)\u001b[48Gso an `em` draws;\u001b[66Gwi\u001b[69Gh no\u001b[74Gitalic RmlUi already\u001b[97Ggged each face\u001b[112Ges\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bs text\u001b[18Gas \u001b[22G problem, so no report was added ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mUI\u001b[39m](ui.md)) |\u001b[71G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m35\u001b[11G\u001b[22m|\u001b[13G2026-1