[0.031, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B 3.009 (Tracy'\u001b[27Gcopy, OFL beside it)\u001b[48Gso an `em` draws;\u001b[66Gwi\u001b[69Gh no\u001b[74Gitalic RmlUi already\u001b[97Ggged each face\u001b[112Ges\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bs text\u001b[18Gas \u001b[22G problem, so no report was added ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mUI\u001b[39m](ui.md)) |\u001b[71G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m35\u001b[11G\u001b[22m|\u001b[13G2026-11-28 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"j27-emissive-scale\"\u001b[39m></a>An em\u001b[63Gssive\u001b[69Gscale\u001b[75Gper\u001b[79Gdraw,\u001b[85GJ27's\u001b[91Grow,\u001b[96Gfor\u001b[100GManifest's\u001b[111Gnoz\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22mzle glow: a mesh's `emissiveScale` (`Scene::MeshCo\u001b[62Gponent`; rgb\u001b[75Ga tint, a\u001b[85Ga scale on\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gintensi\u001b[108Gy,\u001b[111Gall\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B one by default, written only wh\u001b[44Gre set, a negative \u001b[66G refused) multiplies\u001b[87Gits material's emi\u001b[106Gsive\u001b[111Gpar\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bameter (`mesh`, `mesh_triplanar` and `glass` the\u001b[60Gr `emissive`, `planet` \u001b[84Gt\u001b[87Gcities' l\u001b[97Gght\u001b[101G, `unl\u001b[108Gt`\u001b[111Gits\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B colour), carried in the inst\u001b[41Gnce buffer beside the tran\u001b[68Gform (\u001b[75GGpuInstance`, 96 bytes), \u001b[101Go\u001b[103Gdraws diffe\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bring in it stay one instanced draw and no material or model is made per value. Three boxe\u001b[101G of one\u001b[109Gshap\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B at three glows\u001b[27Gdr\u001b[30Gw in o\u001b[37Ge \u001b[40Graw of 36\u001b[50Gtriangles on lavapipe; the render suite\u001b[90Gbatches two\u001b[102Gscales\u001b[109Gas on\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Be draw with each insta\u001b[34Gce its o\u001b[43Gn, the\u001b[50Gscene suite round-trips it; thirteen views at 0\u001b[98Gpixels, the \u001b[111Gm\u001b[113Gk\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1Btest\u001b[18Gpassing ([\u