[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  \u001b[11G\u001b[22m one by default, written only where set, a negative one refused) multiplies it\u001b[91Gmaterial's emis\u001b[107Give\u001b[111Gpar\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bam\u001b[14Gter (`mesh`, `mesh_triplanar` and `glass` their `emissive`, `plane\u001b[81G`\u001b[83Gits\u001b[87Gciti\u001b[92Gs' lights, `unlit`\u001b[111Gits\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bcolour), c\u001b[23Grried in \u001b[33Ghe\u001b[36Gi\u001b[38Gstanc\u001b[44G buffer\u001b[52Gbeside th\u001b[63Gtransform (`Gp\u001b[78GInstance`, 96 bytes), \u001b[101Go draws diffe\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bring in it \u001b[23Gtay\u001b[27Gon\u001b[30G instanced draw and no material\u001b[62Gor model is\u001b[74Gmade per\u001b[83Gvalue. Three boxe\u001b[101G of one shape\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bat th\u001b[18Gee\u001b[21Gglows \u001b[28Grew\u001b[32Gin one draw of 36 triangl\u001b[58Gs on\u001b[63Glavapipe;\u001b[73Gthe re\u001b[80Gder suite batch\u001b[97G two scale\u001b[109Gas on\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Be draw w\u001b[21Gh e\u001b[25Gch instance its\u001b[41Gown,\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gscene su\u001b[59Gte\u001b[62Ground-trip\u001b[74Git; thi\u001b[82Gteen views at\u001b[96G0 pixels, the smok\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Be \u001b[14Gest passing ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mrendering\u001b[39m](rendering.md#a-draw\u001b[59G-\u001b[61Gwn-glow), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](dec\u001b[87Gsions.md#rendering)) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/jettison.lane-c/build/lane.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mline,\u001b[20Gremoved\u001b[28G\u001b[1m8\u001b[30G\u001b[22mlines\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22m # Lan\u001b[16G note (scripts/lanes.sh)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;