[0.113, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison\u001b[12Glane\u001b[17GC\u001b[19Gmust\u001b[24Gstay\u001b[29Gout\u001b[33Gof\u001b[36Gthe\u001b[40Grenderer's\u001b[51Gpipeline\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gprogram\u001b[72Gcode,\u001b[78Gwhich\u001b[84Gshader\u001b[91Greloading\u001b[101Gis\u001b[104Gstill\u001b[110Gchanging.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3GThree pieces fit:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m1. J20: a berth's clamps fitted to the vehicle's shape\u001b[58G\u001b[22m(recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- J12 just gave a vehicle drawn from a model a collision file. Th\u001b[69G clamps\u001b[77Gcan\u001b[81Gnow\u001b[85Ggrip\u001b[90Gwhere\u001b[96Gthat\u001b[101Gshape's\u001b[109Gsides\u001b[115Gare,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gnot\u001b[9Gwhere its\u001b[19Gbox is.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt works in the docks\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31Ganimation\u001b[41Gmodules\u001b[49Gonly,\u001b[55Gso\u001b[58Git\u001b[61Gdoesn't\u001b[69Gclash,\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Git\u001b[83Ghelps\u001b[89GManifest's\u001b[100Ghulls\u001b[106Gdrawn\u001b[112Gfrom\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmodels.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m2. J21: music that crossfades between pieces, with a playlist\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- It's only in the audio module, so there's no clash.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B can be\u001b[15Gtes\u001b[19Ged\u001b[22Gheadless by checking the\u001b[47Gmixed \u001b[54Gamples.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1m3. J29: the rover's grip\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- It only touches the sample,\u001b[33Gso\u001b[36Git's\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Gsa\u001b[76Gto\u001b[79GManifest.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[19;3H\u001b[?25h"]
