[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[9G\u001b[2m6\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gtakes no \u001b[24Gh\u001b[26Gd\u001b[28Gr compiler fo\u001b[42G development alone (shaderc or glslang would be a dependency), so\u001b[108Ga\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[14G\u001b[22mdev\u001b[18Gloper rebuilds and the \u001b[42Gunning \u001b[50Grogram reads the SPIR-V the build wrot\u001b[89G. A cha\u001b[97Gg\u001b[99Gd program's\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m...\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 422 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mmaterials,\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Goverlay\u001b[37Gand\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Genvironment.\u001b[58GBefore\u001b[65Ga\u001b[67Gdriver\u001b[74Gsees\u001b[79Ga\u001b[81Gfile,\u001b[87Gonly\u001b[92Gits\u001b[96Gwords,\u001b[103Gits\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[16G\u001b[22mgic number and a `main` for its stage are\u001b[58Gcheck\u001b[64Gd;\u001b[67Gsp\u001b[70Grv-val is not carried.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[14G\u001b[22m[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mRendering\u001b[39m](re\u001b[30Gering.md#pr\u001b[42Ggram\u001b[47G-reloaded)\u001b[58G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 428 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m>>>>>>> ee8178e (Docs: programs read again as their SPIR-V changes, and the choice (J27))             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 425 \u001b[22m - **A draw's glow is scaled per instance** (2026-11-28, `Scene::MeshComponent::emissiveScale`). The\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gscale multip\u001b[27Gies the material's emissive\u001b[55Gparameter and trav\u001b[74Gls in the i\u001b[86Gstanc\u001b[92G buffer with the\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[14G\u001b[22mdr\u001b[17Gw's transform, so\u001b[35Ga glow a game moves\u001b[55Ge\u001b[57Gch frame makes no material, \u001b[86Go mod\u001b[92Gl and no batch of\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m3\u001b