[0.145, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 16 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| 2026-11-28 | <a id=\"j20-clamps\"></a>A berth's clamps fitted to a vehicle's shape, J20's first row: `D\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mocks::FindClampGrips` gives where a berth's four clamps meet a vehicle, in the berth's axes with it res\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mting there, found once as the vehicle is defined: two a side a quarter of its length fore and aft, 0.34\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m of its height up (`kClampAlong`, `kClampGripHeight`, the retired sample's bite). A box vehicle is grip\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mped on its box's sides; one naming a collision file where a ray in across the berth from the box's side\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m first meets its shape (`PhysicsWorld::CastRayOnShape`, a ray on a defined shape alone, which the snaps\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mhot picker now casts through too), within a quarter of the beam (`kClampTravel`); a clamp with no side \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242min that reach stays open ([decided](decisions.md#docks)). No state: no save field, no pin moved. The do\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mck suite grips a vehicle of two pods and a keel on its pods' outer sides, half a metre in from its box'\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242ms, its port aft clamp left open with only the keel 2.5 m in, and parked on a berth each grip is where a\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m ray in from beside it meets the body; a box vehicle is gripped on its box's sides; the physics suite c\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242masts on a collision file's shape alone. Reference views 0 pixels, smoke test unchanged ([docks](docks.m\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m    -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242md#where-the-clamps-grip)) |                                                                            \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 17 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 18 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mOpen: no engine scene draws a docked vehicle with clamps (the test content's clamps are static bakes   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 19 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mof the retired sample's box placement, and render_test runs no docks), so no capture of clamps on a    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 20 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mmodel-shaped vehicle was made; Manifest has no clamp dressing yet to consume the grips.                \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  2 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mFree: parked on feature-base. J20 (clamps on a vehicle's shape) merged 2026-11-28, awaiting the batch g\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mate.                                                                                                   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;218;124;92mInferring…\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· 7\u001b[62G 12s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m9.0k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[20C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;0;204;204m1\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · /task