[0.095, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[11Gith\u001b[15GJ\u001b[17Glt's convex hul\u001b[33G bu\u001b[37Glder. \u001b[44Gjetti\u001b[50Gon_bake_collision` (`source/tools/co\u001b[87Glision\u001b[94G) bakes one\u001b[106Gthrough\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B`Bake::CollisionShape`, the library \u001b[48Ghe cook is to call: `collision-<name>` nodes are convex hulls, `co\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bllision-mesh-<name>` meshes, and a mod\u001b[50Gl with neither a convex hull of each\u001b[87Gmesh nod\u001b[97Gof at most 32\u001b[111Gpoi\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bnts. A dock vehicle names one (`Vehicl\u001b[50GDef\u001b[54Gnition::collision`,\u001b[74Goptional, so\u001b[87Gevery file re\u001b[101Gds a\u001b[106G before)\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B and\u001b[16Gcollides as it, \u001b[33G mesh refus\u001b[45Gd. The physics suite drops crates on a\u001b[84Gfil\u001b[88G's pods and the\u001b[104Gkeel betwe\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Ben them where\u001b[25Gthe box would\u001b[39Ghold them; the baker'\u001b[61G suite bakes \u001b[75G model\u001b[82Gwith `collision-`\u001b[100Gnodes and one\u001b[K\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bwithout, the sam\u001b[30Gytes twice; `bak\u001b[47G_collision_cli` runs\u001b[68Gthe tool; the\u001b[82Gdock\u001b[87Gsuite defines a vehicle fro\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bm one. No pin moved ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mphysics\u001b[39m](physics.md#a-mode\u001b[60Gs-collision-shape), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mdecisions\u001b[39m](decisions.md#physics))\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B |\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  (another command ran in this repository at the same time; a change made by either may show under either \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mresult)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mMerging\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Gserver\u001b[22Gpicker,\u001b[30Gthen\u001b[35Grunning\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Gtwo\u0