[0.059, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDecision number:\u001b[22m it clashed with L41's D-125, so I renumbered it D-127.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe server picker\u001b[22m (Manifest)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GIt opens when no server is given on the command line. Saved servers live in the terminal UI's existing list, with\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btokens written owner-only.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI moved its password field's style into \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest.rcss\u001b[39m beside the text fields.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe whole ctest passed (69 of 69).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThree of its commit messages still say D-127, while the files say D-128.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA bare \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmanifest_client\u001b[39m now opens the picker; use \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m--scenario trading\u001b[39m to play locally straight away.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mJ20's clamps\u001b[22m (Jettison)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GClamps on a vehicle with a collision file now grip its shape, worked out once per definition.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA clamp with no side within reach stays open.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GBox vehicles are unchanged, and no pins or frames moved.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI couldn't capture it: no engine scene draws docked clamps, and Manifest has no clamp dressing yet to use the\u001b[115Ggrips.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAlso fixed:\u001b[15G\u001b[22m14\u001b[18Glinks\u001b[24Gin\u001b[27GManifest's\u001b[38Gdocs\u001b[43Gstill\u001b[49Gpointed\u001b[57Gat\u001b[60GJettison\u001b[69Groadmap\u001b[77Gentries\u001b[85Gthat\u001b[90Ghave\u001b[95Gmoved\u001b[101Gto\u001b[104Gits\u001b[108Ghistory.\u001b[117GThey\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gpoi\u001b[7Gt at the hist\u001b[21Gry \u001b[25Gow.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C