[0.054, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22mthe bodies. |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 333 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| A program's descriptor read again | A program's SPIR-V is read again as it changes ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mprograms reload\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m   \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;230;219;116med\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](rendering.md#programs-reloaded)); its `.program.yaml`, which names its stages and the parameters i\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bts materials set, is not. |                                                                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 334 \u001b[22m | Cube maps and texture arrays in files | |\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[14G\u001b[22mNormal mapping in `m\u001b[35Gsh` | Wa\u001b[44Gts for tangent-space\u001b[65Gvertex\u001b[72Gdata,\u001b[78Gwhich\u001b[84G`math/Tangents.h`\u001b[102Gmakes.\u001b[109GA\u001b[111Gpla\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22mnet bui\u001b[20Gds its frame from the sphere and do\u001b[56Gs not n\u001b[64Ged i\u001b[69G. |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m336\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| Air over\u001b[23Ga mesh | The haze i\u001b[43G the planet's own surface's\u001b[71Gand\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gsky's,\u001b[86Gnot\u001b[90Gthat\u001b[95Gof\u001b[98Ga\u001b[100Gmesh\u001b[105Gwithin\u001b[112Gth\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22me\u001b[14Ga\u001b[17G, no\u001b[23Gof a transparent draw. Two bodie\u001b[56G' air and rings are not sorted where \u001b[94Ghey\u001b[98Goverlap on the s\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bcreen.\u001b[19G|\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mPushed to \u001b[1mfeature-base\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m11\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mJettison\u001b[12Gis\u001b[15Gpushed,\u001b[23G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m5831e49..2c14127\